            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cw05u",
              "content": "どんな柄でも、1点から。",
              "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "fill": "#1F1B18",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 420
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cw05v",
              "content": "これまでのコピー。機能が一言で伝わるので、説明文・検索向けの文として継続",
